sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Learner
  participant CA as ChapterActivity
  participant VM as LessonViewModel (Orbit)
  participant P as lessonparser
  participant R as Room
  participant W as WorkManager
  U->>CA: open chapter
  CA->>P: read assets/lessons-<lang>/tutorial-<id>.json
  P-->>VM: chapters[] → lessons[]
  VM-->>U: render modules (p lazy, code interactive)
  U->>VM: answer / run
  VM->>R: upsert lesson_progress(in_queue=1)
  R->>W: enqueue sync
  VM-->>U: feedback via visible-if wrong/correct
  W->>W: POST /v1/tutorials/{id}/progress
  W->>R: DELETE synced rows
